OL,3,GNEWSAConkers secured for return of
OL,4,Aworld championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe World Conker Championships are to
OL,7,Freturn next month after organisers
OL,8,Fconcluded there was "a sufficient
OL,9,Fnumber of large playing conkers".
OL,11,FConcerns had been raised as to whether
OL,12,Fthere would be enough fresh conkers to
OL,13,Fhold the annual event, which takes
OL,14,Fplace at Southwick, Northamptonshire.
OL,16,FChair Jim Packer said: "We have been
OL,17,Fsurprised by the number and quality of
OL,18,Fconkers still on the trees, after the
OL,19,Fextreme weather we have had during the
OL,20,Fyear."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
